"title": "GV-4 · External data",
"domain": "Governance",
"url": "research/governance.html#gv4",
"text": "External data Verbatim: \"Participants are allowed to use any additional data sources, provided that the participants possess a license that permits the data to be used in this challenge and shared with the sponsor for evaluation purposes.\" Staff reaffirmed this in 11528 in answer to a question about subscription-only data. GeoDAWN is CC0 1.0; INGENIOUS is CC BY 4.0 — both satisfy the condition."
