"title": "PF-5 · The gravity family",
"domain": "Potential field",
"url": "research/potential-field.html#pf5",
"text": "The gravity family - Sources: band tags; (Glen et al. 2022, regional Great Basin gravity and magnetic maps); - Claim: 13 isostatic gravity anomaly · 5 its slope · 11 its vertical gradient · 18 its horizontal gradient. The source release is described as \"generated from new and existing sources to support ongoing efforts to characterize geothermal resource potential\". - Relevance: Gravity is independent evidence from magnetics. A lineament in both band 18 and band 3/6 is hard to explain away. - Confidence: verified for band tags and the release description. Unverified: that the competition's gravity bands derive from that specific release — band provenance is undocumented beyond the tags."
